<title>MALAYSIA: TABLE-Perstima year net down 74.4 pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Perstima year net down 74.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		   3.59   vs	  14.07</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	  3.0    vs	  12.10</p>
<p>    Turnover		   351.72   vs	 385.88</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	     6.60   vs	  19.54</p>
<p>    Minorities		   nil    vs  less   0.03</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	    0.73   vs	   nil</p>
<p>    Dividend   (percent)     2.0    vs	   8.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Perusahaan Sadur Timah Malaysia Bhd is involved in the tin plating industry.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-206 2323)</p>
